Server:  SIT-CDC.SIT-CDC.SYMBINGP.SOC
Address:  10.17.28.42

*** SIT-CDC.SIT-CDC.SYMBINGP.SOC can't find 104.20.23.154: Non-existent domain

C:\Users\sit.lab2>nslookup -query=MX example.com
Server:  SIT-CDC.SIT-CDC.SYMBINGP.SOC
Address:  10.17.28.42

Non-authoritative answer:
